{"type":"npc","name":"Shrubmerged","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":120,"temp":0,"max":120,"details":""},"ac":{"value":24,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"swim","value":25}],"details":""},"weaknesses":[{"type":"fire","value":9,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"slashing","value":5,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["fey","muan","thalassic"],"details":""},"level":{"value":6},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Shrubmerged are plants that live in swamps, serving as protectors of both the terrestrial and aquatic environments. These tree-like hedges can subsist on land and in water thanks to their lengthy roots, and the shelter these roots provide for smaller creatures accentuates their role as guardians.</p><p>Shrubmerged take pride in their ability to defend their habitats. They act quickly whenever they sense that someone has harmed the swamp, such as through overfishing or draining the water. Shrubmerged mete out vigilante justice, violently punishing intruders as they see fit. If their targets surrender or flee, shrubmerged typically let them off with a warning that they must never return to the swamp.</p><p>Shrubmerged are quick to form grudges and slow to let them go. If someone who formerly harmed the swamp returns, even if they are genuinely repentant, the shrubmerged will most likely conclude they weren't violent enough the first time.</p><h2>Fear of Fire</h2><p>Like many tree creatures, shrubmerged fear and hate creatures who use fire above all others. If a shrubmerged is burned, it does its best to flee, often submerging itself underwater. While the battle may be over, the war has just begun; once burned, a shrubmerged stealthily follows its tormentor, looking for an opportunity to snuff out its foe's life like a candle.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 30/65/125 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (light, medium), skill items (Athletics, Nature, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, constitution, dexterity, earth, earth armor, energy resistant (vitality), intelligence, sensory (low-light vision), strength, tangle shield, throwing, water, wild, wisdom, wood</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Javier Roque","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":5},"dex":{"mod":2},"con":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":2},"wis":{"mod":2},"cha":{"mod":0}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":14,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":12,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":15},"nature":{"base":14},"stealth":{"base":14}},"traits":{"value":["amphibious","plant"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"E0iKYyBMI2b9Bkmv","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/shrubmerged.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Shrubmerged","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/shrubmerged.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/shrubmerged.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Reactive Strike","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"reactive-strike","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.W7SbTykXrNwxDzJc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"9suW1erjOkB1aCfO"},{"type":"action","name":"Personal Swamp","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>15 feet. The shrubmerged's roots spread out and saturate the ground with water, creating thick mud that is difficult terrain. The area is also difficult terrain for swimming creatures.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","traits":["earth","primal","water"],"effects":[],"radius":15}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","earth","primal","water"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"E9F00ezQKBoLz4vj","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Muddy Water","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>When the shrubmerged damages a creature with a water jet Strike, mud particles collected in the water encumber them. The target must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:24] save. On a failure, the target takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 minute or until it [[/act escape dc=24]]{Escapes}; on a critical failure, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round or until it Escapes and then takes –10-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 minute or until it Escapes.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.R3saji8R3pcZY6tq]{Effect: Muddy Water}</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"mjIlceRFADQtzBDY","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Murky Camouflage","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Mud collected on the shrubmerged's roots makes the water around them murky. When fully submerged in water, the shrubmerged can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hide} from other creatures even if they don't have cover against them and aren't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} from them.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"zOzprrreAguNnH2M","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Water Stride","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The shrubmerged can stand and move on the surface of water without falling through. This ability allows them to ignore the difficult terrain from their Personal Swamp. They can go underwater if they wish, but they must Swim to do so.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"wT8AIwMDLsTfjHnh","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Wall of Shrubbery","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The shrubmerged rouses nearby foliage and extends their roots into the soil, creating a thick wall of plant matter with the effects of a 4th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.KsWhliKfUs3IpW3c] spell, but the shrubmerged can move through the wall unimpeded without taking any damage and each of the wall's segments has weakness 9 to fire damage. The shrubmerged can't use Wall of Shrubbery again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Wall of Shrubbery]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","plant","primal","wood"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":3},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"sMBI1qnTiMSBdTIt","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Entrapping Roots","system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The shrubmerged's turn begins</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Roots attempt to drag one creature within the shrubmerged's personal swamp closer. The creature must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:24] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and becomes temporarily immune to Entrapping Roots for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is pulled 5 feet closer to the shrubmerged. This is forced movement.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature is pulled 10 feet closer.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"